{'symbol': 'MAA', 'date': '2021-12-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'MAA ANNOUNCES INCREASE TO QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'GERMANTOWN, TENN., DEC. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MAA (NYSE: MAA)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $1.0875 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO BE PAID ON JANUARY 31, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JANUARY 14, 2022, REPRESENTING A 6.1% INCREASE OVER THE PRIOR RATE.'}